# Pulse session workflow

**Superseded by `.cursor/rules/earn-worth-ship-protocol.mdc`** — follow EARN-WORTH loop every message.

Before implementing:

1. Read `docs/SHIP-NOW-WORKFLOW.md` and `docs/PROJECT-PULSE.md`.
2. Confirm **one scope** (pulse repo only unless user names another product).
3. For shared marketing CSS or deploy: still ship in one pass after scope block.

Before marking done:

1. Run `pnpm ship:now` (or `pnpm quake:gates`).
2. Browser-verify UI at 375 + 1280 when marketing/admin changed.
3. Write `data/quake-os/waves/YYYY-MM-DD-*.md` for any shipped feature pass.

Commit when user says **ship**, **finish**, **finish all**, or **earn your worth**.

Never invent pilot claims, stats, or "production ready" without `docs/PILOT-EXECUTION-STATUS.md` alignment.
